DECLARATION:
This manuscript presents Ripple Effect Theory as an original theoretical proposal with a complete and pre-specified experimental programme. No empirical data have been collected and no experimental result is claimed. All figures that show model output are labelled as model-computed illustrations; they are not data. Claude (Anthropic) was used under direction of author to formalise theory; author remains responsible.

